# 🧱 Deterministic Logic (Purely Derived)

We rely on:

### 1️⃣ ES_Flow
* If band worsened → structural deterioration
* If improved → structural recovery
* If unchanged → check ERI/EVI direction

### 2️⃣ ERI_Flow
* Delta < 0 → polarity deterioration
* Delta > 0 → polarity improvement

### 3️⃣ EVI_Flow
* Tier shift upward → fragmentation escalation
* Tier shift downward → consolidation

### 4️⃣ Pattern_Flow
* Escalating / Crisis → forward fragility
* Recovering / Stabilizing → durability improving

### 5️⃣ RF Tier
* Short-term urgency tier escalation → operational pressure

### 6️⃣ PEM_Guidance

Use only:
* mode
* urgency_band
* recommended_stream_bias

Not as override. As directional confirmation.

